`workspace_count` is variable, not C integer constant expression. Array bound at file scope needs constant. Clang folds it as GNU extension.

Best fix: omit bound from extern declaration.

```c
/* dwm.h */
extern TreeNode *workspace_roots[];
```

Define sized array once, after `config.h` loads:

```c
/* dwm.c */
TreeNode *workspace_roots[LENGTH(workspaces)];
```

`extern ... []` declares incomplete array type. Definition supplies real size. No warning.

